-然后通过 `envFrom` 引用 Secret 安装：
+创建 `huaweicloud-values.yaml`，由 Operator 直接从 Secret 注入配置。不要把 AK/SK
+写入 `operator.extraArgs`，否则凭据会出现在 Deployment 和进程参数中。
+
+```yaml
+ipam:
+  mode: huaweicloud
+routingMode: native
+enableIPv4Masquerade: false
+endpointRoutes:
+  enabled: true
+extraArgs:
+  - --huawei-cloud-trunk-interface=<TRUNK_INTERFACE>
+  - --huawei-cloud-subnet-ids=<SUBNET_ID_1>,<SUBNET_ID_2>
+operator:
+  image:
+    override: <YOUR_OPERATOR_IMAGE>
+  extraEnv:
+    - name: HUAWEI_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY
+      valueFrom: {secretKeyRef: {name: cilium-huaweicloud, key: HUAWEI_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY}}
+    - name: HUAWEI_CLOUD_SECRET_KEY
+      valueFrom: {secretKeyRef: {name: cilium-huaweicloud, key: HUAWEI_CLOUD_SECRET_KEY}}
+    - name: HUAWEI_CLOUD_PROJECT_ID
+      valueFrom: {secretKeyRef: {name: cilium-huaweicloud, key: HUAWEI_CLOUD_PROJECT_ID}}
+```
+
+安装前先渲染，确认 Secret key 引用位于 Operator 容器的 `env` 中：
 
 ```bash
-helm install cilium ./install/kubernetes/cilium \
+helm template cilium ./install/kubernetes/cilium \
   --namespace kube-system \
-  --set ipam.mode=huaweicloud \
-  --set routingMode=native \
-  --set enableIPv4Masquerade=false \
-  --set endpointRoutes.enabled=true \
-  --set extraArgs[0]="--huawei-cloud-subnet-ids=<SUBNET_ID_1>,<SUBNET_ID_2>" \
-  --set operator.image.override=<YOUR_OPERATOR_IMAGE> \
-  --set operator.extraArgs[0]="--huawei-cloud-project-id=<PROJECT_ID>" \
-  --set operator.extraArgs[1]="--huawei-cloud-vpc-id=<YOUR_VPC_ID>"
-```
-
-##### 仅调试：参数直接注入（不推荐用于生产）
